---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";

const seo = {
  title: "AI | Lauro",
  description: "My current stance on AI (and how it's used on this website)",
};
---

<Page seo={seo}>
  <h1>My stance on AI</h1>

  <p>
    Everything I write and create here is made by me. I don't use AI to write my blog posts.
    But I feel it's fair for those who are completely against it to disclose that I do use Claude Code for manual development tasks.
  </p>

  <h2>What's mine</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Every blog post. Ideas, words and edits
    </li>
    <li>The photos, lists and everything else you read on these pages.</li>
    <li>
      Decisions about what this website says, how it looks and how it feels.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p>Posts carry this badge at the bottom, as a reminder:</p>

  <p>
    <a class="not-ai" href="https://notbyai.fyi/" target="_blank">
      <Image
        src="/assets/notAI.png"
        alt="Written by a human, not by AI"
        width={131}
        height={42}
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </a>
  </p>

  <h2>Where I do use it</h2>
  <p>
    I use development tasks, but only manual work: things like upgrading
    dependencies, moving between tools and implementing changes I've already
    decided on.
  </p>

  <p>
    The code of this website is{" "}
    <a href="https://github.com/lsfgrd/lauro.xyz" target="_blank">
      public on GitHub
    </a>
    , if you're curious about how it's built.
  </p>

  <p>
    <small>Last updated: 18/10/2026</small>
  </p>
</Page>

<style>
  .not-ai::after {
    content: none !important;
  }
</style>
